A2AD5F7"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "139549390805633", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_768510353320152_9100528013614776320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mgEXzAgLK3MQ7kNvwGj4WjH&_nc_oc=Adqq4N0RuMCuDi1STx6_OwEx8bKXzNrKXKvpSFvqBk72k1aKIgqsqFzZ4ZD7cooWwPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-IaOm2cxNk71nXUMue5BxJZDwiF7yGlJRRMbAMw_vNnQ&oe=6A2AE2B6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoThumb_2560x1440.png", "id": "347740935677671", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162743_347740939011004_7535046003687161856_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-17rpgulXcAQ7kNvwGgwMSx&_nc_oc=AdrnxYR-3Avxe-NfkVUEtaqlM2NwsvFqa98XlvtdTstUh_mFhI16v4eY3hWiFGeyLV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8BAGnG2jrRyuyPn1RTx30aG4xXBfCOFilHKWhnSnPn3g&oe=6A2AB4B9"}, "display_name": "PaperLander Demo", "keywords": ["paper", "rocket", "gravity", "cute", "free"], "long_description": "PaperLander is a fragile rocket made out of - you guessed it - paper. He lives in PaperGalaxy, a low gravitational fantasy world far far away, made mostly out of paper too.\n\nBut now the Galaxy is in danger. A Space Storm is approaching and threatens to tear it apart. Only one thing can stop the Storm: The Great Anti-Storm Ion Cannon! But it works only with Proto-Stars. And Proto-Stars are scattered in the Galaxy, across its many Sectors. These Sectors are connected by a network of teleporters that activate upon landing. PaperLander's mission is to find and collect those Stars, pass through the Sectors using the teleporters and bring them to the Anti-Storm Ion Cannon in time to save the Galaxy!\n\nBuild your own PaperLander here: http://thiswayupgames.com/PaperLanderModel.pdf\n\n--------------------------------\n\nPlease note that the game might run a bit slower on some Galaxy S7 phones due to low performance graphics 